//// @hidden
//// Independent transaction-body vectors generated with Lucid Evolution 0.6.2's
//// CML, including CML.hash_script_data. No Aiken reconstruction helper is used.
//// The Plutus V3 cost model is Scalus 1.3.0's bundled Preview model.
//// Inputs are 10..10#1 (script) and 80..80#0 (other), or 10..10#0 (other)
//// and 80..80#1 (script). Same-transaction cases use 20..20#0 and #1.
//// The script hash is 02 repeated 28 times; the wallet key hash is 04 repeated
//// 28 times. Each body has fee 1,000,000, a 21,000,000-lovelace output,
//// collateral 90..90#0, total collateral 1,500,000, and return 98,500,000.
//// Reference-input cases include a0..a0#0. All use network 0 except *_mainnet.
//// The negative bodies commit to the malformed shape named by their constant;
//// tests hash these actual bodies and name the proof NFT with that hash.
//// Output-encoding variants preserve the same values while exercising exact
//// bytes, inline datums, and reference scripts. Their complete bodies were
//// decoded and round-tripped with CML without changing their encoding.

